  "description": "MOH 731 (Ver. July 2023) 3.6 Nutrition and HIV, step 2: the encounters with a nutrition status, ranked per client by status_rank (latest encounter first), so the base keeps each client's latest status in the period -- the source query's NOT EXISTS on a later status.",
